# @@name@@

A small library. It exposes one method, `Greeting.greeting(name)`, which returns `Hello, <name>.` and throws `IllegalArgumentException` for a blank name.

## Build

```
gradle build
```

Gradle and a JDK 21 are needed. The project has no Gradle wrapper. Run `gradle wrapper` once if you want one.

## Test

```
@@test_command@@
```

## Use

```java
import @@java_package@@.Greeting;

System.out.println(Greeting.greeting("Ada"));
```
